00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,460
 Now, there are two things you're probably thinking of,

26
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:02,100
 immediately when you see this, right?

27
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,260
 Number one, well, this is only to find

